    "description": "<p>Essence imbues the Lawgiver's arrow with great force. This Charm supplements an Archery-based attack. If the attack hits and rolls even one die of damage, the enemy's player rolls (Stamina + Resistance) against a difficulty of (the attack's post-soak damage dice). On failure, the attack knocks the enemy away from the Exalt a number of yards equal to the Exalt's Essence. Objects do not get a roll, but are instead knocked back automatically if (the raw damage x 50) exceeds the object's weight in pounds.</p>",
